B.bxl=new A.aMA("Login","Create ","your own Web Store"," and start selling ","in less than 5 minutes"," with ","Get started","Your own e-commerce in just 3 simple steps for free:","Create a user and log in","Create your virtual store","Publish products ","Online!","1 MINUTE","2 MINUTES","2 MINUTES","Try demo","Opening demo...","Everything you need to sell","Professional tools integrated into a single platform to manage your business from start to finish.",B.aOF,"View plans & pricing","Plans & Pricing",u.f1,B.aQr,"They trust us","Businesses already selling with Madio Express","What our clients say",B.aJE,"About us",B.aNP,"Our Team","The people behind Madio Express.",B.aV4,"Your store in good hands","Professional cloud infrastructure so you can focus on selling",B.aQH,"Frequently asked questions","We answer your questions before you start",B.aSR,"Follow us on social media","and stay up to date with new features","Contact us")
